WEBVTT

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:03.036
yagona imkoniyat 
Yer sayyorasiga ko'z tikish emas,

00:07:03.036 --> 00:07:08.029
balki kosmos bo'ylab tarqalishdan iborat.

00:07:08.029 --> 00:07:10.436
Ushbu muhim savollarga javoblar
shuni ko'rsatadiki,

00:07:10.436 --> 00:07:16.296
so'nggi yuz yil ichida 
ulkan yutuqlarga erishdik.

00:07:16.296 --> 00:07:20.363
Ammo yuz yildan keyin ham 
olg'a ildamlashda davom etishni istasak,

00:07:20.363 --> 00:07:24.586
bizning kelajagimiz kosmosda.

00:07:24.586 --> 00:07:26.999
Shuning uchun men
uchuvchi tomonidan boshqarila-

00:07:26.999 --> 00:07:35.918
-digan kosmik parvozni 
yo'lga qo'yish tarafdoriman.